 decision who will  he choose to side with his precious  friend Patri who wants to take down the  clover kingdom or his precious teacher  Julius who wants to save it in the end  he can't choose both helped him get  through his hellish childhood both were  there for him when no one else was so he  meets Julius at the royal capital he  tells him about poetry William says that  they will have to decide what's going to  happen among themselves before he  transforms into poetry so that the two  can battle Julius doesn't blame William  he believes that everything he did for  poetry was the result of his kindness  Patri and Julius go on to fight Julius  could have won the battle but he was  holding back likely because he didn't  want to kill William his precious  student and friend in the end Julius is  forced to sacrifice his own life to save  the people of the royal capital from  within his body William cries when he  sees the wizard King meet his end he  apologizes to Julius and congratulate  spa tree then according to poetry he  falls into an endless slumber whether  we've seen the last of William remains  to be seen but he has been an  exceptionally interesting character that  was associated with one of the biggest  twists in the series so far his name  was definitely a clue of what was to  come Vaughn jets is spelled almost  exactly like the word vengeance which is  exactly what Pachi was after he wanted  revenge he wanted to punish all humans  for what he thought they did to the  elves then there's also the fact that  people in mysterious masks are usually  hiding something but in the end it was  still an impactful reveal that provided  important characterization for William  his life was a living nightmare but  Patri and julius helped him make it  through his rough childhood and turn his  life around they were both the most  important people in Williams life and  they wanted completely opposite things  although most of us me included probably  tied with Julius it i